@startuml Netty RPC 请求-响应匹配机制时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

participant "Client Thread" as Client
participant "NettyRemotingClient" as RpcClient
participant "ResponseFuture" as Future
participant "FUTURE_TABLE" as Table
participant "Channel" as Channel
participant "NettyClientHandler" as ClientHandler
participant "Server Channel" as ServerChannel
participant "JdkDynamicServerHandler" as ServerHandler
participant "MethodInvoker" as Invoker

== 阶段1: 客户端发送请求 ==

Client -> RpcClient: sendSync(transporter)
activate RpcClient

RpcClient -> RpcClient: 创建 TransporterHeader
note right of RpcClient
  **生成唯一 opaque**
  TransporterHeader.of(methodIdentifier)
  → opaque = REQUEST_ID.getAndIncrement()
  → opaque = 1 (假设)
end note

RpcClient -> RpcClient: getOrCreateChannel(serverHost)
RpcClient -> Channel: 获取或创建 Channel
Channel --> RpcClient: Channel 对象

RpcClient -> Future: new ResponseFuture(opaque=1, timeout)
activate Future
note right of Future
  **构造函数中：**
  FUTURE_TABLE.put(1, this)
  存储到全局表中
end note

Future -> Table: put(opaque=1, future)
activate Table
Table -> Table: ConcurrentHashMap.put(1, future)
Table --> Future: 存储成功
deactivate Table

Future --> RpcClient: ResponseFuture 对象
deactivate Future

RpcClient -> Channel: writeAndFlush(transporter)
activate Channel
note right of Channel
  **请求包含：**
  - opaque = 1
  - methodIdentifier
  - body (参数)
end note

Channel -> Channel: 通过 TCP 发送请求
Channel --> RpcClient: 发送成功（异步）
deactivate Channel

RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse()
activate Future
note right of Future
  **阻塞等待响应**
  CountDownLatch.await(timeout)
  线程在此处阻塞
end note

== 阶段2: 服务端接收和处理请求 ==

ServerChannel -> ServerHandler: channelRead(Transporter)
activate ServerHandler

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: transporter.getHeader().getOpaque()
note right of ServerHandler
  **获取请求的 opaque**
  opaque = 1
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: transporter.getHeader().getMethodIdentifier()
ServerHandler -> Invoker: methodInvoker.invoke(args)
activate Invoker

Invoker -> Invoker: 执行方法调用
Invoker -> Invoker: 生成结果
Invoker --> ServerHandler: result
deactivate Invoker

== 阶段3: 服务端返回响应 ==

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 构建响应
note right of ServerHandler
  **关键：使用请求的 opaque**
  TransporterHeader.of(
    transporter.getHeader().getOpaque(),  // opaque = 1
    methodIdentifier
  )
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: Transporter.of(header, response)
note right of ServerHandler
  **响应包含：**
  - opaque = 1 (与请求相同)
  - methodIdentifier
  - body (结果)
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerChannel: writeAndFlush(response)
activate ServerChannel
note right of ServerChannel
  **通过同一个 Channel 发送响应**
  响应中包含 opaque = 1
end note

ServerChannel -> ServerChannel: 通过 TCP 发送响应
ServerChannel --> ServerHandler: 发送成功（异步）
deactivate ServerChannel
ServerHandler --> ServerChannel: 处理完成
deactivate ServerHandler

== 阶段4: 客户端接收响应 ==

Channel -> ClientHandler: channelRead(Transporter)
activate ClientHandler

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: transporter.getHeader().getOpaque()
note right of ClientHandler
  **获取响应的 opaque**
  opaque = 1
end note

ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(opaque=1)
activate Table
note right of Table
  **根据 opaque 查找 ResponseFuture**
  FUTURE_TABLE.get(1)
end note

Table --> ClientHandler: ResponseFuture (opaque=1)
deactivate Table

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 反序列化响应
ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: JsonSerializer.deserialize(body)

ClientHandler -> Future: setIRpcResponse(response)
activate Future
Future -> Future: this.iRpcResponse = response
Future --> ClientHandler: 设置成功
deactivate Future

ClientHandler -> Future: putResponse(response)
activate Future
Future -> Future: this.iRpcResponse = response
Future -> Future: latch.countDown()
note right of Future
  **唤醒等待的线程**
  CountDownLatch.countDown()
  阻塞的 waitResponse() 被唤醒
end note

Future -> Table: remove(opaque=1)
activate Table
Table -> Table: FUTURE_TABLE.remove(1)
Table --> Future: 移除成功
deactivate Table

Future --> ClientHandler: 响应已设置
deactivate Future

ClientHandler --> Channel: 处理完成
deactivate ClientHandler

== 阶段5: 客户端获取结果 ==

Future -> Future: waitResponse() 返回
note right of Future
  **CountDownLatch 被唤醒**
  返回 IRpcResponse
end note

Future --> RpcClient: IRpcResponse
deactivate Future

RpcClient --> Client: 返回结果
deactivate RpcClient

== 并发请求示例 ==

note over Client, Table
  **同一个 Channel 可以并发发送多个请求**
end note

group 请求1
    Client -> RpcClient: sendSync(request1, opaque=1)
    RpcClient -> Table: put(1, future1)
    RpcClient -> Channel: writeAndFlush(request1)
    RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse() (阻塞)
end

group 请求2
    Client -> RpcClient: sendSync(request2, opaque=2)
    RpcClient -> Table: put(2, future2)
    RpcClient -> Channel: writeAndFlush(request2)
    RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse() (阻塞)
end

group 请求3
    Client -> RpcClient: sendSync(request3, opaque=3)
    RpcClient -> Table: put(3, future3)
    RpcClient -> Channel: writeAndFlush(request3)
    RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse() (阻塞)
end

note over ServerChannel: **服务端可以乱序返回响应**

group 响应2先到达
    ServerChannel -> ClientHandler: channelRead(response2, opaque=2)
    ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(2)
    Table --> ClientHandler: future2
    ClientHandler -> Future: future2.putResponse(response2)
    Future -> Future: 唤醒等待 future2 的线程
end

group 响应1后到达
    ServerChannel -> ClientHandler: channelRead(response1, opaque=1)
    ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(1)
    Table --> ClientHandler: future1
    ClientHandler -> Future: future1.putResponse(response1)
    Future -> Future: 唤醒等待 future1 的线程
end

group 响应3最后到达
    ServerChannel -> ClientHandler: channelRead(response3, opaque=3)
    ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(3)
    Table --> ClientHandler: future3
    ClientHandler -> Future: future3.putResponse(response3)
    Future -> Future: 唤醒等待 future3 的线程
end

note over Client, Table
  **通过 opaque 匹配，不关心响应顺序**
  每个请求都有独立的 ResponseFuture
  响应可以乱序到达，都能正确匹配
end note

== 总结 ==

note over Client, Invoker
  **关键机制：**
  
  1. **opaque 唯一标识**：每个请求有唯一的 opaque
  2. **Future 存储**：以 opaque 为 key 存储 ResponseFuture
  3. **响应匹配**：响应中包含请求的 opaque，用于查找 Future
  4. **阻塞等待**：使用 CountDownLatch 实现阻塞等待
  5. **并发支持**：同一个 Channel 可以并发发送多个请求
  6. **乱序支持**：响应可以乱序到达，通过 opaque 匹配
  
  **不依赖 Channel，而是依赖 opaque 匹配！**
end note

@enduml
